    "规则": {
      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "本条只写 StockCharts《Pring's Know Sure Thing (KST)》文内 **长期月线** 参数零轴核（相对已入日频W2624/周频W2626）。用月收盘：RCMA1=SMA6(ROC9)，RCMA2=SMA6(ROC12)，RCMA3=SMA6(ROC18)，RCMA4=SMA9(ROC24)；KST=1·RCMA1+2·RCMA2+3·RCMA3+4·RCMA4。月末：若 **KST>0** → SPY，否则 BIL。不是日/周参数；不是信号线。计入美股/ETF。提出日期 1992-01-01。"
    },
